Description: FlickOS developer kit: Git, a C compiler and the everyday command-line tools
 The tools most programmers reach for first: git, the GNU compiler and
 make, the gdb debugger, curl, jq, ripgrep, fd, shellcheck, sqlite3 and
 GitHub's gh. The other kits depend on this one.
 .
 A kit is installed from Software's Developer Tools and removed there too.
 Nothing it installs runs until it is used (docs/design/flickos-dev.md).
